The matrix is a list of 1, 4, 7, 11, 15, 2, 5, 8, 12, 19, 3, 6, 9, 16, 22, 10, 13, 14, 17, 24, 18, 21, 23, 26, and 30.
The target is 5.
The row is 0.
The column is 4.
The found is 0.
Repeat while row is less than 5 and column is at least 0 and found is 0.
The cell is row times 5 plus column.
The value is item cell of matrix.
If value is target, set found to 1.
If value is more than target, set column to column minus 1.
If value is less than target, set row to row plus 1.

If found is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
